2026-09-10 Creator Ecosystem Weekly Meeting Minutes (Excerpt)
Topic 3: Review of Monetization Arbitrage for Account C-21623
1) In the past 30 days, this account published 62 pieces of content, of which 41 were 9-15 second spliced videos with no substantive information, all carrying product links from the same S-860;
2) It used a combination of 'low-price traffic attraction + high-commission products'; in 30 days, commission revenue was 18,600 yuan, while content production cost was less than 200 yuan;
3) Risk scoring: on 2026-09-17, it was penalized 1 time for false advertising, scoring 20 points; this monetization arbitrage scores 30 points; under the same account entity, 4 other accounts using the same template are associated, scoring 10 points; cumulative total 60 points;
4) Tiering rules: 0-19 low / 20-39 medium / 40-69 relatively high / 70-94 high / 95 and above extremely high; this time it falls into the relatively high tier;
5) Conclusion: restrict this account's product-linking permission for 30 days, add it to the watchlist, and review upon expiration.
Before the meeting, an operations colleague mentioned that in the afternoon of 2026-10-10, they would align settlement standards with a risk control specialist from a certain bank; that is a meeting on the settlement workstream and is unrelated to this topic, and it is also kept on file.
